OL,3,GNEWSAMurder inquiry after man shot dead
OL,4,Ain Armadale
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 35-year-old man who died in a
OL,7,F"targeted attack" in West Lothian had
OL,8,Fbeen shot with a firearm, police have
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FDetectives said they were treating the
OL,12,Fdeath of Billy Watson in Armadale as
OL,13,Fmurder and were keen to map the
OL,14,Fmovements of two vehicles.
OL,16,FWatson died at the scene of the
OL,17,Fincident on Harestanes Road at about
OL,18,F11:50 on Saturday.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
