OL,3,GNEWSAMurder inquiry after man shot dead
OL,4,Ain Armadale
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 57-year-old man has been arrested
OL,7,Fover the death. Police later said they
OL,8,Fwere looking for information about four
OL,9,Fmen who were seen in the area at the
OL,10,Ftime.
